```turtle
# 使用 TriG 格式（.trig）支持多命名图
# 场景：多业务单元共享本体，数据隔离

<http://corp.example.com/graph/business-unit-A> {
    kb:supplier_a001 a kb:Supplier ;
        kb:supplierName "BU-A Supplier"^^xsd:string .
}

<http://corp.example.com/graph/business-unit-B> {
